@startuml
!include style.puml
skinparam ArrowFontStyle plain
skinparam ParticipantFontColor #FFFFFF

participant ":LogicManager" as Logic LOGIC_COLOR
participant "c:RoleCommand" as Command LOGIC_COLOR
participant "m:Model" as Model MODEL_COLOR

note over Logic, Command
Input has been parsed as role 1 buyer.
The client remains visible after the update.
end note

Logic -> Command : execute(m)
activate Command
Command -> Model : getFilteredPersonList()
activate Model
Model --> Command : lastShownList
deactivate Model

note over Command
Validate the displayed index.
Copy the client with the new role;
preserve all other fields.
end note

Command -> Model : setPerson(clientToEdit, editedClient)
activate Model
Model --> Command
deactivate Model

Command -> Model : getFilteredPersonList()
activate Model
Model --> Command : updated displayed clients
deactivate Model

note over Command
Find the replacement client's displayed index.
If hidden, return feedback without a view index.
end note

Command --> Logic : result:CommandResult
deactivate Command

note over Logic
Persistence and history recording follow
the command result and are omitted here.
end note
@enduml
